# Model: Todo
### Entities
- entity TodoItem
  - Id: Guid key required immutable
  - Title: string required
  - IsCompleted: bool default=false
- value-object TodoDto
  - Id: Guid required
  - Title: string required
  - IsCompleted: bool
- enum TodoStatus

### Relationships
- TodoItem 1-1 TodoDto: projection of the persisted entity

### Invariants
- INV-1: A todo item title is never empty
- INV-2: A todo item identity is immutable once assigned
